# Trivy CVE allowlist for the wolf-scanners images.
#
# Each entry is a CVE ID, one per line. Include a comment explaining
# WHY this CVE is acceptable for THIS image — never a blanket bypass.
# When upstream releases a fix, the entry should be removed.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # reason (image: <which one>, decided <date>, expires <date or "until upstream fix">)
#
# Empty for now — add entries only when a real CVE blocks publishing
# AND the fix isn't available upstream. ignore-unfixed is set in the
# workflow so CVEs without a fix don't fail the build either way.
